message: "If you use this software in your research or systems, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Multimodal Financial Document Intelligence & Hybrid RAG Engine"
abstract: >
  Multimodal Hybrid RAG system for financial document analysis (SEC 10-K, 10-Q, earnings releases).
  Combines layout-aware chunking, vision-LLM chart extraction, BM25 + Dense Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF),
  Maximal Marginal Relevance (MMR) diversity filtering, cross-encoder reranking, Program-of-Thought (PoT)
  numeric guardrails, and level-aware generation checks.
version: 2.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-15"
